        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">MPPT regulator; 1 MPPT, nizov na MPPT [2], U_dc max 150 (abs.), 145 zagon/obratovanje V, MPPT - V, I max - A; komunikacija: VE.Direct, Bluetooth Smart, remote on/off L/H (2-polni konektor), programabilni rele NO/C/NC (DPST; AC 240 V/4 A, DC 4 A do 35 V, 1 A do 60 V)</elementInformation>
